    "ex": "Who taught you English? What happened?",
    "use": "Tipik xato joyi"
   },
   {
    "s": "Indirect: Could you tell me where … is?",
    "uz": "muloyim so'roq — oddiy gap tartibi",
    "ex": "Could you tell me where the station is?",
    "use": "Speaking: muloyimlik"
   },
   {
    "s": "I wonder if/whether …",
    "uz": "qiziqaman, … mi",
    "ex": "I wonder whether it will rain.",
    "use": "Speaking: fikr yuritish"
   },
   {
    "s": "❌ Can you tell me where is the bank? → ✅ where the bank is",
    "uz": "indirect savolda tartib almashmaydi",
    "ex": "Do you know what time it starts?",
    "use": "Tipik xato"
   },
   {
    "s": "Question tags: isn't it? / don't you?",
    "uz": "tasdiq kutish",
    "ex": "It's a lovely day, isn't it?",
    "use": "Tabiiy muloqot"
   },
   {
    "s": "Negative questions: Don't you think …?",
    "uz": "fikringizni yumshoq bildirish",
    "ex": "Don't you think exams are too stressful?",
    "use": "Part 3 munozara"
   },
   {
    "s": "Rhetorical questions in Task 2 — avoid",
    "uz": "Task 2 da ritorik savol yozmang",
    "ex": "❌ But is this really true? → ✅ However, this view is debatable.",
    "use": "Akademik uslub"
   }
  ]
 },
